<title>UK: NWB sets 300 million guilder 10-year bond. [CORRECTED 10:58 GMT]</title>
<headline>NWB sets 300 million guilder 10-year bond. [CORRECTED 10:58 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Rabobank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NEDERLAND WATERSCHAPSBANK</p>
<p> AMT    300 MLN DFL   COUPON     5.625     MATURITY    26.MAR.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.535   PAY DATE    26.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	REOFFER    99.86     SPREAD	+15.5 BP</p>
<p>(Corrects spread from +16 BP).</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    AMST	PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 5-10	TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> GOV LAW    DUTCH     MGT/UND    0.325     SELL CONC  1.675</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 5.75 PCT SEPT 2007 DSL  NOTES	ISSUED OFF AN EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
